以下为 MathRSI 首页 ECC 成果卡片（[index.html](file:///Users/rfy_naiveai/Desktop/MathRSI/development/homepage-redesign-20261105/site/index.html#L115-L136) 中 `#ecc-research-demo` 挂载点）的可展开交互方法示例方案与完整中英文文案。方案严格对齐 [PR19.diff](file:///Users/rfy_naiveai/Desktop/MathRSI/development/evolution/ecc-node-v4-20261111/PR19.diff) 的节点协议与代数事实、遵循 [styles.css](file:///Users/rfy_naiveai/Desktop/MathRSI/development/homepage-redesign-20261105/site/styles.css) 的浅色 Geist 视觉规范，并原生兼容 [i18n.js](file:///Users/rfy_naiveai/Desktop/MathRSI/development/homepage-redesign-20261105/site/i18n.js) 的原位文本节点翻译与状态保持机制。

---

## 1. 整体设计思路与防混乱原则

1. **主卡片成果优先，默认收起为单行入口**：
   - 置于 `.meta` 下方、`Scope & verification` 上方（即现有 `<div id="ecc-research-demo"></div>` 位置），使用原生 `<details class="ecc-org">` 折叠。
   - 未展开时仅占一行，首屏标签明确写明 **`Research organization example · [72, 36, ≥16]` / `研究组织示例 · [72, 36, ≥16]`**，视觉权重不抢上方的四项精确距离等式。
2. **上下分区 + 端口徽章路由，彻底消除跨线箭头**：
   - 将画布分为上下两个独立视觉层（中间用紧凑的 **端口徽章 `[→ A]`、`[→ B · h=34]`、`[→ C · E=S]`** 对齐，不画斜穿分类树的跨线箭头）：
     - **上层：分类树与余类账本（Classification Tree & Remainders）**——三列并排（350px 窄屏仍可保持紧凑三列或单行手风琴卡片）展示互斥穷尽的 **A / B / C** 三枝。每枝内固定区分 **「局部可触子域（Local family）」**（实线浅绿底）与 **「必须保留的未覆盖余类（Uncovered remainder）」**（虚线灰底）。
     - **下层：固定母码共享计算条（Shared Computation Strip）**——单列紧凑横条，展示固定 35 维自正交母码 $S$ 的一次扩张计算 $C = S + \langle v \rangle\ (v \notin S)$ 如何按 $v$ 的初等代数性质分发给三个局部切片。
3. **文字常驻不闪、无勾号、无假进度条**：
   - 三步说明与 A/B/C 分枝说明全部常驻 DOM（或仅切换 `data-step="1|2|3"` 与 `data-branch="A|B|C"` 的高亮边框和底色），不使用 `opacity: 0 → 1` 的重挂载闪烁。
   - **严禁出现 `✓` 勾号、百分比、加载转圈或假进度条**；步骤指示器采用 `1 · 2 · 3` 胶囊按钮，明确标注 `No live scan · Organizational example only / 无实际扫描在跑 · 仅演示研究组织`。
4. **尺寸与响应式适配（400–600px 桌面 / 350px 手机）**：
   - 容器支持 `width: 100%; max-width: 560px`（当在卡片内展开或跨列检视时自适应 `350px–600px`），内边距紧凑（桌面 `14px`，手机 `10px`），展开后总高度控制在 `~360px` 以内，无需翻屏即可一眼看全三步逻辑。

---

## 2. 最小 DOM 与 SVG 结构（挂载于 `#ecc-research-demo`）

[i18n.js](file:///Users/rfy_naiveai/Desktop/MathRSI/development/homepage-redesign-20261105/site/i18n.js#L17-L61) 按归一化完整文本节点和 `aria-label` 查表替换。因此数学记号用 `<code data-no-i18n>` 隔离，自然语言保持为独立纯文本节点：

```html
<details class="ecc-org" id="ecc-org-details">
  <summary class="ecc-org-summary">
    <span class="ecc-org-kicker">Research organization example · <code data-no-i18n>[72, 36, ≥16]</code></span>
    <span class="ecc-org-cta">How branch classification &amp; shared computation work</span>
  </summary>

  <div class="ecc-org-body" data-step="1" data-branch="B">
    <!-- 顶部状态条：明确无新解答、无实际扫描 + 播放控制 -->
    <div class="ecc-org-bar">
      <span class="ecc-org-badge">Organizational example only · no new solution or live scan</span>
      <div class="ecc-org-ctls" role="group" aria-label="Example steps and playback">
        <button type="button" class="ecc-ctl" id="eccPlay" aria-label="Play 3-step walkthrough">Play</button>
        <button type="button" class="ecc-ctl" id="eccReplay" aria-label="Replay from step 1">Replay</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3步切换器（手动点击或自动推进，文字常驻） -->
    <div class="ecc-steps" role="tablist" aria-label="Research organization steps">
      <button type="button" role="tab" class="ecc-step-btn" data-step-target="1" aria-selected="true">
        <span class="ecc-step-num" data-no-i18n>1</span>
        <span>Partition the problem</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" class="ecc-step-btn" data-step-target="2" aria-selected="false">
        <span class="ecc-step-num" data-no-i18n>2</span>
        <span>Reuse shared computation</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" class="ecc-step-btn" data-step-target="3" aria-selected="false">
        <span class="ecc-step-num" data-no-i18n>3</span>
        <span>Check coverage &amp; return</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- 当前步骤核心说明（3段常驻DOM，按 data-step 切换显示，不闪烁） -->
    <div class="ecc-step-notes">
      <p class="ecc-step-note" data-for-step="1">
        Every binary linear <code data-no-i18n>[72, 36]</code> code <code data-no-i18n>C</code> falls into one of three mutually exclusive algebraic classes—without assuming self-duality in the original problem.
      </p>
      <p class="ecc-step-note" data-for-step="2">
        One 1-row extension scan <code data-no-i18n>C = S + ⟨v⟩</code> (<code data-no-i18n>v ∉ S</code>) on a fixed 35-dim self-orthogonal parent <code data-no-i18n>S</code> is computed once and routed by <code data-no-i18n>v</code> to three local slices.
      </p>
      <p class="ecc-step-note" data-for-step="3">
        A finished task only updates its exact slice. Ruling out the parent problem requires zero uncovered remainder; proving existence requires just one verified <code data-no-i18n>[72, 36, ≥16]</code> matrix.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 区域一：分类树（A / B / C 可点击分枝卡，局部子域 vs 未覆盖余类分明） -->
    <div class="ecc-tree" role="group" aria-label="Exhaustive three-branch classification">
      <div class="ecc-tree-root">
        <span>Root question: Does a binary linear <code data-no-i18n>[72, 36, ≥16]</code> code exist?</span>
        <!-- 紧凑内联 SVG 分叉线，仅连接根与 A/B/C 顶边，无跨线箭头 -->
        <svg class="ecc-fork-svg" viewBox="0 0 360 16" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M180 0 V8 M60 8 H300 M60 8 V16 M180 8 V16 M300 8 V16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="ecc-branches">
        <!-- Branch A -->
        <button type="button" class="ecc-br" data-branch-id="A" aria-pressed="false">
          <span class="ecc-br-head">
            <b data-no-i18n>A</b>
            <span>Self-dual</span>
            <code data-no-i18n>C = C⊥</code>
          </span>
          <span class="ecc-slice ecc-slice-local">
            <small>Shared <code data-no-i18n>S</code> slice</small>
            <span>Contains <code data-no-i18n>S</code> (or core <code data-no-i18n>K ≤ C</code>)</span>
          </span>
          <span class="ecc-slice ecc-slice-rem">
            <small>Retained remainder</small>
            <span><code data-no-i18n>K ≰ C</code> / other parents</span>
          </span>
        </button>

        <!-- Branch B -->
        <button type="button" class="ecc-br" data-branch-id="B" aria-pressed="true">
          <span class="ecc-br-head">
            <b data-no-i18n>B</b>
            <span>Even, non-self-dual</span>
            <small>18 hull layers <code data-no-i18n>h = 0,2,…,34</code></small>
          </span>
          <span class="ecc-slice ecc-slice-local">
            <small>Shared <code data-no-i18n>S</code> slice · <code data-no-i18n>h = 34</code> only</small>
            <span>Contains inventory <code data-no-i18n>S</code></span>
          </span>
          <span class="ecc-slice ecc-slice-rem">
            <small>Retained remainder</small>
            <span>No inventory <code data-no-i18n>S</code> in <code data-no-i18n>h = 34</code> + all 17 layers <code data-no-i18n>h = 0…32</code></span>
          </span>
        </button>

        <!-- Branch C -->
        <button type="button" class="ecc-br" data-branch-id="C" aria-pressed="false">
          <span class="ecc-br-head">
            <b data-no-i18n>C</b>
            <span>Has odd-weight words</span>
            <small>Unique 35-dim even <code data-no-i18n>E</code></small>
          </span>
          <span class="ecc-slice ecc-slice-local">
            <small>Shared <code data-no-i18n>S</code> slice · <code data-no-i18n>E = S</code> only</small>
            <span><code data-no-i18n>E</code> is self-orthogonal <code data-no-i18n>S</code></span>
          </span>
          <span class="ecc-slice ecc-slice-rem">
            <small>Retained remainder</small>
            <span><code data-no-i18n>E ∉</code> inventory + non-self-orthogonal <code data-no-i18n>E</code></span>
          </span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 区域二：共同计算条（与分类树视觉分离，用端口徽章对齐，不画交叉线） -->
    <div class="ecc-shared" aria-label="Shared parent computation">
      <div class="ecc-shared-head">
        <span class="ecc-shared-title">Shared computation · Fixed 35-dim self-orthogonal parent <code data-no-i18n>S</code></span>
        <span class="ecc-shared-sub">Compute <code data-no-i18n>C = S + ⟨v⟩</code> (<code data-no-i18n>v ∉ S</code>) and coset distances once; route by <code data-no-i18n>v</code>:</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ecc-ports">
        <button type="button" class="ecc-port" data-branch-id="A">
          <span class="ecc-port-cond"><code data-no-i18n>v</code> even, <code data-no-i18n>v ⊥ S</code></span>
          <span class="ecc-port-dest">→ <b>A</b> · self-dual slice</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="ecc-port" data-branch-id="B">
          <span class="ecc-port-cond"><code data-no-i18n>v</code> even, <code data-no-i18n>v ⧸⊥ S</code></span>
          <span class="ecc-port-dest">→ <b>B</b> · <code data-no-i18n>h = 34</code> only (not all 18 layers)</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="ecc-port" data-branch-id="C">
          <span class="ecc-port-cond"><code data-no-i18n>v</code> odd</span>
          <span class="ecc-port-dest">→ <b>C</b> · <code data-no-i18n>E = S</code> only (not all <code data-no-i18n>C</code>)</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 底部常驻分枝检视器：点击 A / B / C 切换高亮，展示该枝在当前步骤下的准确边界 -->
    <div class="ecc-detail-box" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="ecc-branch-pane" data-for-branch="A">
        <p class="ecc-pane-title"><b data-no-i18n>Branch A</b> · Self-dual (<code data-no-i18n>C = C⊥</code>, all words even)</p>
        <p class="ecc-pane-body">Even vectors <code data-no-i18n>v ⊥ S</code> yield 36-dim self-orthogonal codes, hence self-dual. Closing one parent <code data-no-i18n>S</code> or core <code data-no-i18n>K</code> only rules out codes containing it; the remainder <code data-no-i18n>K ≰ C</code> stays open.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ecc-branch-pane" data-for-branch="B">
        <p class="ecc-pane-title"><b data-no-i18n>Branch B</b> · Even, non-self-dual (18 hull layers <code data-no-i18n>h = 0, 2, …, 34</code>)</p>
        <p class="ecc-pane-body">Even vectors <code data-no-i18n>v ⧸⊥ S</code> give Gram rank 2, so <code data-no-i18n>h = 36 − 2 = 34</code>. This touches only the <code data-no-i18n>S</code>-slice of layer <code data-no-i18n>h = 34</code>—never all 18 layers, and never codes in <code data-no-i18n>h = 34</code> outside the <code data-no-i18n>S</code> inventory. One code may contain multiple <code data-no-i18n>S</code>, so per-parent counts cannot be summed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ecc-branch-pane" data-for-branch="C">
        <p class="ecc-pane-title"><b data-no-i18n>Branch C</b> · Contains odd-weight words (unique 35-dim even subcode <code data-no-i18n>E</code>)</p>
        <p class="ecc-pane-body">Odd vectors <code data-no-i18n>v</code> make <code data-no-i18n>S</code> the unique even subcode <code data-no-i18n>E = S</code>. This covers only the slice where <code data-no-i18n>E</code> is the self-orthogonal code <code data-no-i18n>S</code>; codes whose <code data-no-i18n>E</code> is outside the inventory or not self-orthogonal remain open.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="ecc-return-rule">
        <b>Return to root:</b> Non-existence requires every branch and remainder to be covered and verified; existence requires just one matrix passing the original <code data-no-i18n>[72, 36, ≥16]</code> check.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
```

---

## 3. 布局与样式规范（`ecc-research-demo.css`）

完全复用 [styles.css](file:///Users/rfy_naiveai/Desktop/MathRSI/development/homepage-redesign-20261105/site/styles.css#L4-L11) 中的设计变量（`--surface`, `--hair`, `--hair-2`, `--ink`, `--ink-2`, `--muted`, `--ecc`），兼容 350px 窄屏与 400–600px 容器：

```css
#results .ecc-org {
  margin-top: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);
  padding-top: 10px;
  font-size: 13.5px;
  color: var(--ink-2);
}
#results .ecc-org-summary {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 4px 10px;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-weight: 560;
}
#results .ecc-org-kicker {
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ecc) 82%, #000);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 620;
}
#results .ecc-org-cta {
  font-size: 12.5px;
  font-weight: 450;
  color: var(--muted);
}
.ecc-org-body {
  margin-top: 10px;
  padding: 12px;
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--hair);
  border-radius: 12px;
  display: grid;
  gap: 10px;
}
.ecc-org-bar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px;
}
.ecc-org-badge {
  font-size: 11.5px;
  color: var(--muted);
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px dashed var(--hair-2);
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 2px 8px;
}
.ecc-org-ctls { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
.ecc-ctl {
  height: 26px;
  padding: 0 10px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid var(--hair-2);
  background: #fff;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 550;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.ecc-ctl[aria-pressed="true"] {
  background: var(--ink);
  border-color: var(--ink);
  color: #fff;
}

/* 3步导航胶囊 */
.ecc-steps {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 6px;
}
.ecc-step-btn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 6px 8px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--hair);
  background: #fff;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.25;
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: var(--ink-2);
}
.ecc-step-btn[aria-selected="true"] {
  border-color: var(--ecc);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ecc) 9%, #fff);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.ecc-step-num {
  flex: none;
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--surface);
  font: 600 11px/18px var(--mono);
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
}
.ecc-step-btn[aria-selected="true"] .ecc-step-num {
  background: var(--ecc);
  color: #fff;
}

/* 步骤核心文字：常驻高度、不闪烁 */
.ecc-step-note { display: none; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ink); }
.ecc-org-body[data-step="1"] .ecc-step-note[data-for-step="1"],
.ecc-org-body[data-step="2"] .ecc-step-note[data-for-step="2"],
.ecc-org-body[data-step="3"] .ecc-step-note[data-for-step="3"] { display: block; }

/* 区域一：分类树与余类 */
.ecc-tree {
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid var(--hair);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 10px;
}
.ecc-tree-root {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 12.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.ecc-fork-svg {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 14px;
  color: var(--hair-2);
  margin-top: 2px;
}
.ecc-branches {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 6px;
}
.ecc-br {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 7px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--hair);
  background: #fff;
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.ecc-br[aria-pressed="true"] {
  border-color: var(--ecc);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ecc);
}
.ecc-br-head { display: grid; gap: 1px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink); }
.ecc-br-head b { font: 650 13px var(--mono); color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ecc) 82%, #000); }
.ecc-br-head small, .ecc-br-head code { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }

.ecc-slice {
  display: grid;
  gap: 1px;
  padding: 4px 6px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.ecc-slice small { font-weight: 600; font-size: 10.5px; }
.ecc-slice-local {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ecc) 8%, #fff);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ecc) 28%, #fff);
  color: var(--ink);
}
.ecc-slice-local small { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ecc) 82%, #000); }
.ecc-slice-rem {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px dashed var(--hair-2);
  color: var(--muted);
}
/* 第2步强化局部切片边框，第3步强化未覆盖余类边框 */
.ecc-org-body[data-step="2"] .ecc-slice-local { border-color: var(--ecc); }
.ecc-org-body[data-step="3"] .ecc-slice-rem { border-color: var(--ink-2); color: var(--ink); }

/* 区域二：固定母码 S 共同计算条（与分类树分开） */
.ecc-shared {
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid var(--hair);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--ecc);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  display: grid;
  gap: 6px;
}
.ecc-shared-title { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 620; color: var(--ink); }
.ecc-shared-sub { display: block; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); }
.ecc-ports {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 6px;
}
.ecc-port {
  display: grid;
  gap: 2px;
  padding: 5px 7px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  border: 1px solid var(--hair);
  background: var(--surface);
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 11px;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.ecc-port[aria-pressed="true"] {
  border-color: var(--ecc);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ecc) 10%, #fff);
}
.ecc-port-cond { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 550; }
.ecc-port-dest { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ecc) 85%, #000); font-weight: 600; }

/* 底部常驻分枝检视卡 */
.ecc-detail-box {
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid var(--hair);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  display: grid;
  gap: 6px;
}
.ecc-branch-pane { display: none; }
.ecc-org-body[data-branch="A"] .ecc-branch-pane[data-for-branch="A"],
.ecc-org-body[data-branch="B"] .ecc-branch-pane[data-for-branch="B"],
.ecc-org-body[data-branch="C"] .ecc-branch-pane[data-for-branch="C"] { display: block; }
#results .ecc-pane-title { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 3px; }
