          <span class="ecc-slice ecc-slice-rem">
            <small>Retained remainder</small>
            <span><code data-no-i18n>E ∉</code> inventory + non-self-orthogonal <code data-no-i18n>E</code></span>
          </span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 区域二：共同计算条（与分类树视觉分离，用端口徽章对齐，不画交叉线） -->
    <div class="ecc-shared" aria-label="Shared parent computation">
      <div class="ecc-shared-head">
        <span class="ecc-shared-title">Shared computation · Fixed 35-dim self-orthogonal parent <code data-no-i18n>S</code></span>
        <span class="ecc-shared-sub">Compute <code data-no-i18n>C = S + ⟨v⟩</code> (<code data-no-i18n>v ∉ S</code>) and coset distances once; route by <code data-no-i18n>v</code>:</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ecc-ports">
        <button type="button" class="ecc-port" data-branch-id="A">
          <span class="ecc-port-cond"><code data-no-i18n>v</code> even, <code data-no-i18n>v ⊥ S</code></span>
          <span class="ecc-port-dest">→ <b>A</b> · self-dual slice</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="ecc-port" data-branch-id="B">
          <span class="ecc-port-cond"><code data-no-i18n>v</code> even, <code data-no-i18n>v ⧸⊥ S</code></span>
          <span class="ecc-port-dest">→ <b>B</b> · <code data-no-i18n>h = 34</code> only (not all 18 layers)</span>
