        <button type="button" class="ecc-port" data-branch-id="C">
          <span class="ecc-port-cond"><code data-no-i18n>v</code> odd</span>
          <span class="ecc-port-dest">→ <b>C</b> · <code data-no-i18n>E = S</code> only (not all <code data-no-i18n>C</code>)</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 底部常驻分枝检视器：点击 A / B / C 切换高亮，展示该枝在当前步骤下的准确边界 -->
    <div class="ecc-detail-box" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="ecc-branch-pane" data-for-branch="A">
        <p class="ecc-pane-title"><b data-no-i18n>Branch A</b> · Self-dual (<code data-no-i18n>C = C⊥</code>, all words even)</p>
        <p class="ecc-pane-body">Even vectors <code data-no-i18n>v ⊥ S</code> yield 36-dim self-orthogonal codes, hence self-dual. Closing one parent <code data-no-i18n>S</code> or core <code data-no-i18n>K</code> only rules out codes containing it; the remainder <code data-no-i18n>K ≰ C</code> stays open.</p>
