        <p class="ecc-pane-body">Odd vectors <code data-no-i18n>v</code> make <code data-no-i18n>S</code> the unique even subcode <code data-no-i18n>E = S</code>. This covers only the slice where <code data-no-i18n>E</code> is the self-orthogonal code <code data-no-i18n>S</code>; codes whose <code data-no-i18n>E</code> is outside the inventory or not self-orthogonal remain open.</p>
